<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS AT TOSHIBA CLASSIC.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS AT TOSHIBA CLASSIC.</headline>
<dateline>CARLSBAD, California 1996-08-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$450,000 Toshiba Classic tennis tournament on Friday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Quarterfinals:</p>
<p>1-Arantxa Sanchez Vicario (Spain) beat Katarina Studenikova</p>
<p>(Slovakia) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>3-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) beat Sandrine Testud (France)</p>
<p>2-6 7-6 (7-4) 6-3.</p>
<p>4-Kimiko Date (Japan) beat 5-Gabriela Sabatini (Argentina)</p>
<p>6-4 6-1</p>
</text>
